Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.86,0:01:04.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.86,0:01:04.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.55,0:01:06.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨  那个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.55,0:01:06.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, uh
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.50,0:01:09.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.50,0:01:09.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.37,0:01:10.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.37,0:01:10.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.12,0:01:22.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.12,0:01:22.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.10,0:01:23.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.10,0:01:23.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.05,0:01:24.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要来玩捉迷藏吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.05,0:01:24.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You want to play hide-and-seek?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.35,0:01:25.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.35,0:01:25.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.02,0:01:25.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.02,0:01:25.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.76,0:01:28.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,石头旁边那位置应该不错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.76,0:01:28.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I figure that spot over by those rocks is a good place--
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.35,0:01:28.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.35,0:01:28.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.23,0:01:29.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.23,0:01:29.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.85,0:01:33.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是不是得先知道什么是捉迷藏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.85,0:01:33.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do I have to know what hide-and-seek is
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.14,0:01:34.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,才能玩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.14,0:01:34.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,in order to play it?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.86,0:01:37.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拜托  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.86,0:01:37.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.67,0:01:38.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.67,0:01:38.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Quit fooling around
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.75,0:01:40.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,咱捉迷藏都玩过好几十次了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.75,0:01:40.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We've played hide-and-seek dozens of times
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.57,0:01:41.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,几十次吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.57,0:01:41.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Dozens?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.45,0:01:42.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好几千次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.45,0:01:42.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thousands
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.71,0:01:43.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好几千次吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.71,0:01:43.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thousands?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.97,0:01:45.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不是很确定有多少次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.97,0:01:45.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know for sure how many
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.29,0:01:45.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.29,0:01:45.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just--
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.60,0:01:46.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.60,0:01:46.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gosh
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.36,0:01:47.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.36,0:01:47.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gosh what?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.33,0:01:50.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我都不知道捉迷藏有这么多数学啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.33,0:01:50.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I didn't know hide-and-seek had so much mathematics
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.54,0:01:54.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  很简单的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.54,0:01:54.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, it's simple
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.75,0:01:57.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一位要像这样站在石头后面
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.75,0:01:57.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One person stands behind a rock, like this
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.20,0:01:58.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再遮住眼睛数数
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.20,0:01:58.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Then they cover their eyes and count
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.94,0:02:00.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,另外那位跑去藏起来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.94,0:02:00.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,while the other person runs and hides
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.84,0:02:01.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你偷看了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.84,0:02:01.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're peeking
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.43,0:02:03.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你不是说不会玩吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.43,0:02:03.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I thought you said you didn't know how to play
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.14,0:02:03.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,玩什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.14,0:02:03.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Play what?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.95,0:02:06.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,捉迷藏啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.95,0:02:06.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hide-and-seek
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.62,0:02:07.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.62,0:02:07.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, no, no
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.47,0:02:08.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.47,0:02:08.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I do
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.30,0:02:09.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我会玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.30,0:02:09.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I do know how to play
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.95,0:02:10.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.95,0:02:10.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.65,0:02:13.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我只是有个小问题
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.65,0:02:13.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just have one tiny question
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.10,0:02:13.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么问题
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.10,0:02:13.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.76,0:02:14.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么是捉迷藏
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.76,0:02:14.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's hide-and-seek?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.68,0:02:17.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你现在听懂了没  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.68,0:02:17.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You think you're getting it now, Patrick?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.50,0:02:20.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,袜子手偶给你演示明白了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.50,0:02:19.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did you find the sock puppet demonstration
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.41,0:02:20.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to be useful?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.16,0:02:21.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,捉迷藏
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.16,0:02:21.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hide-and-seek
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.06,0:02:22.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,玩家数量为两个及以上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.06,0:02:22.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A game played by two or more players
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.79,0:02:24.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,规则是随机选中一个玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.79,0:02:24.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,in which one player chosen at random
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.84,0:02:27.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大声数到一个预先指定的数字
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.84,0:02:27.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,counts aloud to a predetermined number
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.15,0:02:29.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,其他玩家则藏起来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.15,0:02:29.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,while the remaining players hide
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.17,0:02:31.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等到数到上述的数字
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.17,0:02:31.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Upon reaching said number
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.34,0:02:32.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,数数的玩家就立刻开始
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.34,0:02:32.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the counting player now embarks
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.64,0:02:34.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,去捉其他的玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.64,0:02:34.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,on a search for the other players
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.17,0:02:36.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把所有玩家的位置都找到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.17,0:02:36.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The search continues until all players are located
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.77,0:02:38.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最终赢家就出炉了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.77,0:02:38.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and a winner is determined
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.23,0:02:40.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你完全听懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.23,0:02:40.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You really are getting it
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.55,0:02:42.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,捉迷藏确实听着挺
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.55,0:02:42.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hide-and-seek sure sounds
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.53,0:02:43.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.53,0:02:43.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fun
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.08,0:02:46.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但愿我会玩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.08,0:02:46.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just wish I could play
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.79,0:02:48.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.79,0:02:48.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, come on
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.77,0:02:50.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你当然会玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.77,0:02:50.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course you can play
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.73,0:02:51.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.73,0:02:51.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.45,0:02:53.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.45,0:02:53.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.72,0:02:56.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么不会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.72,0:02:56.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why can't you?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.03,0:02:57.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.03,0:02:57.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Because
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.92,0:02:59.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没有袜子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.92,0:02:59.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't have any socks
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.63,0:03:03.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  别管袜子了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.63,0:03:03.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, forget about the socks
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.55,0:03:05.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么袜子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.55,0:03:05.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What socks?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.55,0:03:06.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.55,0:03:06.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Never mind
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.43,0:03:07.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你数吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.43,0:03:07.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just start counting
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.81,0:03:10.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一二三四
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.81,0:03:10.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,1, 2, 3, 4
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.12,0:03:11.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.12,0:03:11.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.37,0:03:12.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我得跑去藏起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.37,0:03:12.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now I'm gonna run and hide
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.50,0:03:13.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,六七八
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.50,0:03:13.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,6, 7, 8
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.20,0:03:16.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得想好往哪藏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.20,0:03:16.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna mull over where I'm gonna hide
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.44,0:03:31.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,倒是可以藏那地方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.44,0:03:31.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, that's definitely one idea
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.32,0:03:33.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,78  79
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.32,0:03:33.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,78, 79
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.55,0:03:34.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,100
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.55,0:03:34.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,100
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.18,0:03:37.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,捉到了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.18,0:03:37.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I found you
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.60,0:03:38.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.60,0:03:38.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I win
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.72,0:03:39.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你输了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.72,0:03:39.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,In your face
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.12,0:03:43.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我一定是史上最厉害的捉迷藏玩家了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.12,0:03:43.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I must be the greatest hide-and-seek player ever
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.36,0:03:44.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该换我来数数了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.36,0:03:44.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, now it's my turn to count
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.75,0:03:46.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你知道要怎么玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.75,0:03:46.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You know what you're supposed to do, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.76,0:03:47.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那当然
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.76,0:03:47.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.80,0:03:50.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我可是史上最厉害的捉迷藏玩家啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.80,0:03:50.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm the greatest hide-and-seek player ever, aren't I?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.00,0:03:52.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.00,0:03:52.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.02,0:03:53.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.02,0:03:53.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here we go
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.00,0:03:56.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一二三四
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.00,0:03:56.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,1, 2, 3, 4
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.17,0:04:01.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,五六七八九
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.17,0:04:01.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,5, 6, 7, 8, 9
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.23,0:04:03.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你听见没
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.23,0:04:03.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you hear that?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.92,0:04:05.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听见了  什么声音
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.92,0:04:05.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.32,0:04:07.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,原来是海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.32,0:04:07.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.65,0:04:10.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他数什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.65,0:04:10.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why is he counting?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.35,0:04:11.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我还是回家好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.35,0:04:11.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll just go home
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.79,0:04:14.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等会儿他可能会想玩个游戏什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.79,0:04:14.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe later, he'll want to play a game or something
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.25,0:04:16.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,22  23
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.25,0:04:16.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,22, 23
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.23,0:04:18.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,24  25
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.23,0:04:18.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,24, 25
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.66,0:04:20.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,26  27
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.66,0:04:20.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,26, 27
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.12,0:04:23.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,99  100
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.12,0:04:23.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,99, 100
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.65,0:04:26.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他藏哪去了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.65,0:04:26.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, where is he hiding?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.45,0:04:31.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太明显  不可能藏那
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.45,0:04:31.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nah, way too obvious
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.44,0:04:41.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,出来出来  不管你在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.44,0:04:41.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come out, come out, wherever you are
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.97,0:04:54.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.97,0:04:54.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.56,0:04:58.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.56,0:04:58.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.90,0:05:02.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定会比我想象中的难多了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.90,0:05:02.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be harder than I thought
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.75,0:05:09.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.75,0:05:09.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.62,0:05:14.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.62,0:05:14.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:05:16.42,0:05:19.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.42,0:05:19.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.22,0:05:27.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.22,0:05:27.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.53,0:05:32.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.53,0:05:32.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.02,0:05:32.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.02,0:05:32.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.95,0:05:34.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我在跟派大星玩捉迷藏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.95,0:05:34.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm playing hide-and-seek with Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:05:34.32,0:05:36.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道能不能进你家找他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.32,0:05:36.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and I was wondering if I can search for him in your house
Dialogue: 1,0:05:36.22,0:05:36.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不能
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.22,0:05:36.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.30,0:05:38.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就待会儿见
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.30,0:05:38.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, see you
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.14,0:05:38.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.14,0:05:38.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bye
Dialogue: 1,0:05:47.70,0:05:48.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.70,0:05:48.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What the--
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.75,0:05:51.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快找避难所
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.75,0:05:51.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Head for the shelter
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.12,0:05:53.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,末日来得也太早了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.12,0:05:53.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Doomsday came sooner than I thought
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.20,0:05:56.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.20,0:05:56.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.48,0:05:59.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上天怎么会知道我名字
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.48,0:05:59.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How do they know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.75,0:06:01.54,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(416,674)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.75,0:06:01.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板  看上面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.75,0:06:01.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs, up here
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.70,0:06:02.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.70,0:06:02.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.60,0:06:03.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.60,0:06:03.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.70,0:06:05.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我在跟派大星玩捉迷藏
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.70,0:06:05.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm playing hide-and-seek with Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.67,0:06:07.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就爬上了这座招牌找他
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.67,0:06:07.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd look for him up on this sign
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.67,0:06:09.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.67,0:06:09.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.77,0:06:11.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是气死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.77,0:06:11.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That makes me furious
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.64,0:06:12.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放心  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.64,0:06:12.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.84,0:06:13.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,会清干净的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.84,0:06:13.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll clean it up
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.14,0:06:15.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不是那回事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.14,0:06:15.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's not that
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.50,0:06:17.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是你没缴清费用
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.50,0:06:17.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's just that you haven't paid the fee
Dialogue: 1,0:06:17.89,0:06:18.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么费用
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.89,0:06:18.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The fee?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.74,0:06:19.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.74,0:06:19.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You know
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.54,0:06:22.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹堡王捉迷藏玩家费
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.54,0:06:22.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Krusty Krab hide-and-go-seekers' fee
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.70,0:06:25.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在蟹堡王里玩捉迷藏必须交钱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.70,0:06:25.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for playing hide-and-seek on Krusty Krab premises
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.06,0:06:26.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.06,0:06:26.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That one
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.77,0:06:27.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,差点忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.77,0:06:27.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot
Dialogue: 1,0:06:29.22,0:06:30.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  祝你尽快找到他
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.22,0:06:30.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, good luck finding him
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.88,0:06:32.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.88,0:06:32.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.30,0:06:37.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.30,0:06:37.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Darn it
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.39,0:06:47.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哪来的噪音  难听死了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.39,0:06:47.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where could that awful noise be coming from?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.97,0:06:50.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,已经连续吵了好几小时了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.97,0:06:50.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's been going on for hours now
Dialogue: 1,0:06:57.12,0:06:58.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.12,0:06:58.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.55,0:07:02.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨  泡芙老师
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.55,0:07:02.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, Mrs. Puff
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.57,0:07:04.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.57,0:07:04.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:04.05,0:07:06.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,全班都听不清我上课了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.05,0:07:06.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My class can hardly hear me teach
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.42,0:07:07.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要顶起这艘船
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.42,0:07:07.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to lift this boat
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.85,0:07:09.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星估计就藏在底下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.85,0:07:09.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think Patrick's hiding underneath it
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.70,0:07:11.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他没事干嘛藏底下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.70,0:07:11.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why would he be doing that?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:11.36,0:07:13.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为我们在玩捉迷藏
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.36,0:07:13.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,'Cause we're playing hide-and-seek
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.59,0:07:14.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要来玩吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.59,0:07:14.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Want to play?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:14.27,0:07:14.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.27,0:07:14.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:14.91,0:07:16.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.91,0:07:16.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why, no
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.15,0:07:17.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我  我不能
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.15,0:07:17.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I-I couldn't
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.47,0:07:19.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你确定吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.47,0:07:19.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.37,0:07:20.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,确定
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.37,0:07:20.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.08,0:07:22.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你确定你确定吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.08,0:07:22.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're sure?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.54,0:07:23.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,确定
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.54,0:07:23.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.15,0:07:26.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你确定你确定你确定吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.15,0:07:26.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're sure you're sure?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.63,0:07:28.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我很确定
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.63,0:07:28.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm sure
Dialogue: 1,0:07:28.88,0:07:32.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你确定你确定你确定你确定吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.88,0:07:32.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're sure you're sure you're sure?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.49,0:07:33.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,确定
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.49,0:07:33.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:07:33.29,0:07:34.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你确定你确定
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.29,0:07:34.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're sure
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.59,0:07:36.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你确定你确定你确定你确定
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.59,0:07:36.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you're sure you're sure you're sure you're sure
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.19,0:07:39.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你确定你确定你确定你确定吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.19,0:07:39.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you're sure you're sure you're sure you're sure?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.40,0:07:41.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说实在的  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.40,0:07:41.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Actually, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:07:41.52,0:07:43.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,玩就玩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.52,0:07:43.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I will play
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.28,0:07:58.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他不在船底下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.28,0:07:58.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nope, he's not under there
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.80,0:08:00.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢你帮忙检查船底下  泡芙老师
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.80,0:08:00.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks for checking under your car, Mrs. Puff
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.08,0:08:07.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.08,0:08:07.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.96,0:08:09.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.96,0:08:09.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.43,0:08:12.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你拿那把放大镜干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.43,0:08:12.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you doing with that magnifier?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:12.33,0:08:13.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,找派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.33,0:08:13.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Looking for Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.72,0:08:15.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我整天找啊找的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.72,0:08:15.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've been seeking and seeking all day
Dialogue: 1,0:08:15.76,0:08:16.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是找不到他
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.76,0:08:16.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but I can't find him
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.00,0:08:18.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是个坏消息啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.00,0:08:18.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, that's terrible news
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.72,0:08:19.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,确实
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.72,0:08:19.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know
Dialogue: 1,0:08:19.67,0:08:20.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.67,0:08:20.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.20,0:08:22.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就那破玩意  怎么可能拿来找得到他
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.20,0:08:22.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You ain't gonna find him with that sad little thing
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.15,0:08:23.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我这边的东西更好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.15,0:08:23.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got something better
Dialogue: 1,0:08:28.53,0:08:31.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你确定我用这个没事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.53,0:08:31.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you sure it's okay for me to use this?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:31.72,0:08:33.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我特地留着应付紧急情况用
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.72,0:08:33.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I keep it here for emergencies
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.32,0:08:36.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你那是紧急情况吧  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.32,0:08:36.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is an emergency, right, SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.32,0:08:36.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.32,0:08:36.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.85,0:08:38.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错  就是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.85,0:08:38.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, absolutely
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.05,0:08:41.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再次谢谢你  珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.05,0:08:41.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks again, Sandy
Dialogue: 1,0:08:41.85,0:08:43.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,路上小心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.85,0:08:43.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Be careful
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.60,0:09:16.49,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1084,314)}酷乐湖
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.60,0:09:16.49,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(750,656)}水母田
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.60,0:09:16.49,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(498,578)}裤头村
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.64,0:09:40.89,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(792,218)}燃料
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.64,0:09:40.89,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(906,544)}空      半满      满
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.61,0:09:42.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.61,0:09:42.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Darn it
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.64,0:09:45.77,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(828,908)}汽油
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.40,0:09:52.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临天涯海角
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.40,0:09:52.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Welcome to the end of the world
Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.80,0:09:53.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,咖啡及礼品店
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.80,0:09:53.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cafe and gift shop"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.19,0:09:57.82,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(994,620)}欢迎
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.07,0:10:02.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,需要什么服务  孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.07,0:10:02.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can I help you, son?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.89,0:10:04.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我在找我朋友派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.89,0:10:04.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for my friend Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:10:04.75,0:10:07.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是个大胖墩  还长了个尖头吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.75,0:10:07.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He a big, roundish fellow with a pointy head?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:07.07,0:10:07.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.07,0:10:07.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Exactly
Dialogue: 1,0:10:08.15,0:10:09.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没见过
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.15,0:10:09.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Haven't seen him
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.32,0:10:10.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.32,0:10:10.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.92,0:10:11.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还是谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.92,0:10:11.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, thanks anyway
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.92,0:10:12.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等下等下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.92,0:10:12.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.55,0:10:13.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他是粉色的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.55,0:10:13.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is he pink?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.40,0:10:14.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.40,0:10:14.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:10:14.32,0:10:16.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那样的话  他就坐在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.32,0:10:16.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, in that case, he's sitting right over there
Dialogue: 1,0:10:16.00,0:10:16.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还真是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.00,0:10:16.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Solid
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.65,0:10:19.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.65,0:10:19.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.50,0:10:21.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  真的是你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.50,0:10:21.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, it really is you
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.02,0:10:23.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我叫派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.02,0:10:23.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My name is Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:10:23.61,0:10:25.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星才怪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.61,0:10:25.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick notstar
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.59,0:10:27.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星才怪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.59,0:10:27.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick notstar?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.52,0:10:30.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.52,0:10:30.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:10:30.67,0:10:32.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你不是我要找的那位
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.67,0:10:32.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You aren't the one I'm seeking
Dialogue: 1,0:10:32.90,0:10:34.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这下彻底找不到派大星了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.90,0:10:34.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now I'll never find Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:10:35.07,0:10:36.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他捉迷藏赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.07,0:10:36.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He wins at hide-and-seek
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.98,0:10:37.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.98,0:10:37.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He wins
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.67,0:10:38.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.67,0:10:38.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He wins
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.86,0:10:39.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以说他赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.86,0:10:39.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So he wins
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.41,0:10:42.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又有什么好难过的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.41,0:10:42.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's so bad about that?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.51,0:10:44.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他赢了  我就输了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.51,0:10:44.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, if he wins, I lose
Dialogue: 1,0:10:44.97,0:10:46.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你玩得开心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.97,0:10:46.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did you have fun playing?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:47.37,0:10:48.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,开心
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.37,0:10:48.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.40,0:10:50.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那输了也没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.40,0:10:50.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, then it's okay to lose
Dialogue: 1,0:10:51.10,0:10:53.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只要开心就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.10,0:10:53.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,as long as you had fun doing it
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.16,0:10:55.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.16,0:10:55.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're right
Dialogue: 1,0:10:56.30,0:10:58.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  派大星才怪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.30,0:10:58.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Patrick notstar
Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.50,0:10:59.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.50,0:10:59.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And just one more thing
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.90,0:11:00.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.90,0:11:00.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.80,0:11:02.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你有没有一块钱  我想借一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.80,0:11:02.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you have a dollar I could borrow?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.77,0:11:12.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  原来你一直都在这底下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.77,0:11:12.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, you were under there the whole time?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.60,0:11:13.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哪里底下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.60,0:11:13.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Under where?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.07,0:11:16.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我  我本来要把这字条留给你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.07,0:11:16.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I-I was just leaving you this note
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.85,0:11:19.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,亲爱的派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.85,0:11:19.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Dear Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.05,0:11:20.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我找不到你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.05,0:11:20.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"I couldn't find you
Dialogue: 1,0:11:20.67,0:11:21.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以你赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.67,0:11:21.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"so you win
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.12,0:11:25.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过没关系  我玩得还是很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.12,0:11:25.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"But that's okay, because I still had fun playing
Dialogue: 1,0:11:25.95,0:11:28.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你简直就是最厉害的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.95,0:11:28.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"You are truly the greatest
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.52,0:11:32.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,捉迷藏玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.52,0:11:32.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"hide-and-seek player
Dialogue: 1,0:11:32.21,0:11:34.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,全世界独一无二
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.21,0:11:34.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"in the whole world
Dialogue: 1,0:11:35.14,0:11:37.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,爱你的  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.14,0:11:37.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Love, SpongeBob"
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.07,0:11:38.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.07,0:11:38.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why, thanks, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:11:39.08,0:11:40.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是意义重大
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.08,0:11:40.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That really means a lot
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.67,0:11:42.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  我说的话都是认真的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.67,0:11:42.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, I wouldn't say it if I didn't mean it
Dialogue: 1,0:11:43.12,0:11:44.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过我有个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.12,0:11:44.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just have one question
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.70,0:11:45.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,问吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.70,0:11:45.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ask away
Dialogue: 1,0:11:45.90,0:11:47.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么是捉迷藏
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.90,0:11:47.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's hide-and-seek?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.68,0:11:51.18,起司 特殊标题,,0,0,0,,冒牌小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.44,0:11:53.69,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(269.33,464)}分镜总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.44,0:11:53.69,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(475.661,716)}编剧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.44,0:11:56.11,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1096,976.667)}翻译{\fnArial}: 1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.81,0:11:56.11,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(393.575,408)}创意总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.81,0:11:56.11,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(513.742,662)}动画总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.23,0:11:58.65,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(431.6,534)}制片指导
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.23,0:11:58.65,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1034.667,976.667)}本字幕仅限学习交流\N严禁用于商业用途
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.73,0:12:00.74,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(392,462)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.74,0:12:02.03,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(802,590)}开
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.03,0:12:03.32,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(802,590)}关
Dialogue: 1,0:12:03.84,0:12:05.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,晚安  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.84,0:12:05.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good night, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.47,0:12:06.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这么快就关门了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.47,0:12:06.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Closing time already?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.58,0:12:09.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我刚给最后一位客人端上了个蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.58,0:12:09.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just served a Krabby Patty to the last customer
Dialogue: 1,0:12:09.42,0:12:10.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就晚安了  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.42,0:12:10.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, have a good night, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.08,0:12:13.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板  我能不能打包一份蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.08,0:12:13.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs, is it okay if I buy a Krabby Patty to go
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.90,0:12:15.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我家宠物蜗牛小蜗吃
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.90,0:12:15.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for my pet snail Gary?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:15.39,0:12:17.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还以为这种东西都吃蜗牛粮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.39,0:12:17.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I thought those things ate mostly kibble
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.34,0:12:20.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这可是特别奖励  帮小蜗为明天准备
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.34,0:12:20.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's a special treat just to get him ready for tomorrow
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.00,0:12:21.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.00,0:12:21.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Right
Dialogue: 1,0:12:22.25,0:12:23.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,价格总共是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.25,0:12:23.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, that makes--
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.20,0:12:24.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.20,0:12:24.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.63,0:12:25.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,明天啥日子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.63,0:12:25.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's tomorrow?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.31,0:12:27.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板  你忘了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.31,0:12:27.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs, did you forget?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.95,0:12:28.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,多半是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.95,0:12:28.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Probably
Dialogue: 1,0:12:28.48,0:12:31.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,明天是带宠物上班日
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.48,0:12:31.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow is bring your pet to work day
Dialogue: 1,0:12:31.47,0:12:33.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那种事根本不用特别办节日
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.47,0:12:33.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't need a special day for that
Dialogue: 1,0:12:33.33,0:12:34.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,毕竟章鱼哥每天都上班
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.33,0:12:34.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward's here every day
Dialogue: 1,0:12:35.21,0:12:36.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.21,0:12:36.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nice
Dialogue: 1,0:12:36.90,0:12:38.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太好笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.90,0:12:38.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Real nice
Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.03,0:12:41.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能买那蟹黄堡吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.03,0:12:41.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can I buy that patty?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:41.03,0:12:41.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.03,0:12:41.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure
Dialogue: 1,0:12:41.90,0:12:43.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.90,0:12:43.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right
Dialogue: 1,0:12:43.18,0:12:46.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗一定会特兴奋的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.18,0:12:46.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary's gonna be so excited
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.53,0:12:49.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  差点忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.53,0:12:49.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob I almost forgot
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.65,0:12:51.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,宠物价格要翻倍
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.65,0:12:51.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The price is double for pets
Dialogue: 1,0:12:51.52,0:12:53.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为宠物很特别
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.52,0:12:53.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,because they're so special
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.45,0:12:54.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这个好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.45,0:12:54.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good idea
Dialogue: 1,0:12:57.47,0:12:58.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再次谢谢你  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.47,0:12:58.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks again, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.62,0:13:00.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.62,0:13:00.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.94,0:13:01.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.94,0:13:01.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:01.93,0:13:02.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.93,0:13:02.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just
Dialogue: 1,0:13:06.88,0:13:07.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,咋了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.88,0:13:07.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:07.56,0:13:08.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,咋了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.56,0:13:08.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.14,0:13:09.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹黄堡都卖光了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.14,0:13:09.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're all out of Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.97,0:13:10.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,冰库检查过没
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.97,0:13:10.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did you check the freezer?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.88,0:13:12.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我检查过冰库  备用冰库
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.88,0:13:12.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I checked the freezer, the spare freezer
Dialogue: 1,0:13:12.64,0:13:14.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,后备冰库  额外冰库
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.64,0:13:14.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the backup freezer, the extra freezer
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.10,0:13:14.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,后方冰库
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.10,0:13:14.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the rear freezer
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.67,0:13:16.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,微型冰库  还有楼梯底下的冰库
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.67,0:13:16.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the microfreezer, and the freezer under the stairs
Dialogue: 1,0:13:16.52,0:13:18.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,阁楼的冰库检查过没
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.52,0:13:18.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What about the freezer in the attic?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:18.12,0:13:19.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹堡王没阁楼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.12,0:13:19.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We don't have an attic
Dialogue: 1,0:13:19.97,0:13:21.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没阁楼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.97,0:13:21.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No attic?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:21.07,0:13:22.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,被你卖了  忘了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.07,0:13:22.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You sold it, remember?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:22.55,0:13:23.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,啊对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.55,0:13:23.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.25,0:13:26.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们在说什么  凯伦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.25,0:13:26.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now what are they saying, Karen?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:27.00,0:13:27.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,凯伦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.00,0:13:27.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Karen
Dialogue: 1,0:13:27.69,0:13:29.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.69,0:13:29.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have no idea
Dialogue: 1,0:13:29.29,0:13:29.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.29,0:13:29.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:29.89,0:13:31.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你明明都说过自己会读唇语的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.89,0:13:31.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I thought you said you could read lips
Dialogue: 1,0:13:31.77,0:13:34.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,会是会  但你把我望远镜拿走了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.77,0:13:34.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can, but you took my telescope away
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.29,0:13:37.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就这么定了  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.29,0:13:37.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, that settles it, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.16,0:13:39.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,明天得现做一批蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.16,0:13:38.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're just gonna have to make
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.33,0:13:39.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a fresh batch of Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:13:39.90,0:13:41.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现做一批
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.90,0:13:41.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A fresh batch?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:41.27,0:13:42.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就这么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.27,0:13:42.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's what I said
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.80,0:13:45.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现做一批蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.80,0:13:45.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A fresh batch of Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.59,0:13:47.30,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(628,776)}海之霸
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.90,0:13:47.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在他说什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.90,0:13:47.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, now what's he saying?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.48,0:13:51.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他说他们要现做一批蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.48,0:13:49.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He said that they're going to make
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.09,0:13:51.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a fresh batch of Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.14,0:13:52.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现做一批
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.14,0:13:52.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A fresh batch of
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.25,0:13:54.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.25,0:13:54.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is good
Dialogue: 1,0:13:54.40,0:13:55.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.40,0:13:55.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is real good
