Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.89,0:13:57.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,When are we making this fresh batch
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.37,0:13:58.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹黄堡  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.37,0:13:58.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of Krabby Patties, Mr. Krabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.96,0:13:59.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.96,0:13:59.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:59.60,0:14:00.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他刚说什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.60,0:14:00.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, what'd he just say?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.92,0:14:01.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.92,0:14:01.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.34,0:14:03.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我说  他刚说什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.34,0:14:03.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I said, "what'd he just say?"
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.80,0:14:05.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他说  什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.80,0:14:05.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He said, "what?"
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.06,0:14:06.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.06,0:14:06.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have no idea
Dialogue: 1,0:14:06.63,0:14:08.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以才要问你他说了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.63,0:14:08.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm asking you what he just said
Dialogue: 1,0:14:08.95,0:14:11.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我知道  所以我才说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.95,0:14:11.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know that, and I'm saying
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.07,0:14:12.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他说  什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.07,0:14:12.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,he said, "what?"
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.24,0:14:13.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.24,0:14:13.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know that
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.44,0:14:13.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.44,0:14:13.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We--
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.85,0:14:15.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他刚刚说  什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.85,0:14:15.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He said "what?"
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.63,0:14:16.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.63,0:14:16.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.12,0:14:20.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要现做整整一批蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.12,0:14:20.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A whole new, fresh batch of Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.12,0:14:22.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗一定会欣喜若狂
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.12,0:14:22.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary's gonna go crazy
Dialogue: 1,0:14:22.22,0:14:23.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要知道啊  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.22,0:14:23.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You know, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.42,0:14:26.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感觉不太建议
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.42,0:14:26.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,might not be such a good idea
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.08,0:14:27.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把一只脏蜗牛带进厨房里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.08,0:14:27.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,bringing a dirty snail into the kitchen
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.20,0:14:30.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不然还是改天再办
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.20,0:14:30.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think we might just want to reschedule
Dialogue: 1,0:14:30.40,0:14:31.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,带宠物上班日好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.40,0:14:31.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,bring your pet to work day
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.67,0:14:34.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.67,0:14:34.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nooo
Dialogue: 1,0:14:34.22,0:14:38.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板  我发誓小蜗一定会特干净
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.22,0:14:38.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs, I promise that Gary will be sparkly clean
Dialogue: 1,0:14:38.30,0:14:40.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今晚我就给小蜗洗个特别久的澡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.30,0:14:40.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll give him an extra-long bath tonight
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.65,0:14:41.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.65,0:14:41.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.95,0:14:44.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定要给它洗得健康又干净
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.95,0:14:44.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just make sure he's healthy and clean
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.44,0:14:46.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,健康又干净吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.44,0:14:46.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Healthy and clean?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.32,0:14:48.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现做一批蟹黄堡吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.32,0:14:48.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fresh batch of Krabby Patties?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.83,0:14:50.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,计划来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.83,0:14:50.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think I smell a plan
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.88,0:14:56.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.88,0:14:56.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.38,0:14:59.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我给你买了份好吃的点心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.38,0:14:59.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I brought you a delicious treat
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.10,0:15:01.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你在这啊  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.10,0:15:01.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There you are, gare bear
