Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.47,0:15:03.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I brought you some kelp fries
Dialogue: 1,0:15:06.76,0:15:08.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,本来要给你带蟹黄堡的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.76,0:15:08.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was gonna bring you a Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.17,0:15:09.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,结果卖光了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.17,0:15:09.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but we ran out
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.47,0:15:11.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我去给你准备洗澡水  你慢慢吃
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.47,0:15:11.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll go and get your bath ready while you enjoy those
Dialogue: 1,0:15:14.04,0:15:15.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.04,0:15:15.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.06,0:15:16.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,洗澡水准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.06,0:15:16.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,your bath is ready
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.06,0:15:17.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.06,0:15:17.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.32,0:15:20.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.32,0:15:20.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.27,0:15:25.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.27,0:15:25.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:27.40,0:15:28.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.40,0:15:28.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.01,0:15:33.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗  又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.01,0:15:33.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary, not again
Dialogue: 1,0:15:33.63,0:15:34.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快出来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.63,0:15:34.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come out of there
Dialogue: 1,0:15:34.48,0:15:35.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很脏的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.48,0:15:35.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's dirty
Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.01,0:15:38.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,捉到了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.01,0:15:38.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gotcha
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.10,0:15:42.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别闹了  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.10,0:15:42.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:15:42.29,0:15:43.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要再惹麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.29,0:15:43.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Quit messing around
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.52,0:15:49.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗  这下可好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.52,0:15:49.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Great, Gary, just great
Dialogue: 1,0:15:49.92,0:15:50.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得给你洗个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.92,0:15:50.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now you're gonna need
Dialogue: 1,0:15:50.61,0:15:53.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,特别特别特别特别久的澡了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.61,0:15:53.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,an extra-extra-extra-extra-long bath
Dialogue: 1,0:15:53.93,0:15:55.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你不下来是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.93,0:15:55.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna come down from there, are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:57.15,0:15:58.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,算你赢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.15,0:15:58.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You win
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.10,0:15:59.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,明早再给你洗澡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.10,0:15:59.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We'll bathe you in the morning
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.15,0:16:07.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早安  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.15,0:16:07.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good morning, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.40,0:16:09.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我叫清壳大师谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.40,0:16:09.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My name is Sheldon R. Shellcleaner
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.57,0:16:10.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拥有并经营
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.57,0:16:10.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,owner and operator
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.48,0:16:13.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,超级清壳大师度假无限公司
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.48,0:16:13.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of super shellcleaner vacations unlimited
Dialogue: 1,0:16:13.23,0:16:14.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能问你个问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.23,0:16:14.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can I ask you a question?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:14.73,0:16:16.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是不是烦透了身上的壳老变脏
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.73,0:16:16.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you tired of your dirty shell
Dialogue: 1,0:16:16.54,0:16:18.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,害得你不辞辛劳  连着几小时
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.54,0:16:18.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,resulting in tireless hours of--
Dialogue: 1,0:16:18.40,0:16:22.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗  我要准备洗澡水了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.40,0:16:22.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary, I'm going to start the bath
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.60,0:16:24.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就直说了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.60,0:16:24.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look, I'll just cut to the chase
Dialogue: 1,0:16:24.14,0:16:26.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你壳脏吗  讨厌洗澡吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.14,0:16:26.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you have a dirty shell and hate bath time?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:27.60,0:16:29.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.60,0:16:29.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course you do
Dialogue: 1,0:16:29.07,0:16:31.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以我才要为你介绍限时特惠
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.07,0:16:31.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's why I must tell you about our limited-time offer
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.06,0:16:36.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,奢华度过非四非三  而是一夜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.06,0:16:36.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for not four, not three, but one luxurious night
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.26,0:16:39.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,畅玩背壳旅社
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.26,0:16:39.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,here at club shell
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.35,0:16:41.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,正适合蜗牛的度假胜地
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.35,0:16:41.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a perfect resort for snails
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.39,0:16:42.43,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(726,840)}背壳旅社
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.43,0:16:44.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这不是梦  不用掐自己
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.43,0:16:44.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't try to pinch yourself
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.12,0:16:44.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这一切
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.12,0:16:44.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This could be
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.96,0:16:48.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗  洗澡水好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.96,0:16:48.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary, the bath is ready
Dialogue: 1,0:16:48.32,0:16:49.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,专属于你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.32,0:16:49.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All yours
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.67,0:16:51.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我知道你在想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.67,0:16:51.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, I know what you're thinking
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.09,0:16:52.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都包在我身上了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.09,0:16:52.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but I got you covered
Dialogue: 1,0:16:52.45,0:16:55.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,临时壳可以提供给你戴着
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.45,0:16:55.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A temporary shell will be provided for you to wear
Dialogue: 1,0:16:55.03,0:16:56.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你自己的壳就放这给他洗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.03,0:16:56.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,while yours is being cleaned
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.41,0:16:59.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然这些全都免费
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.41,0:16:59.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And all of this is free of charge, of course
Dialogue: 1,0:16:59.62,0:17:02.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗  你的洗澡水好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.62,0:17:02.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary, your bath is ready
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.82,0:17:05.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,祝你入住愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.82,0:17:05.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Have a pleasant stay
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.37,0:17:07.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一路顺风
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.37,0:17:07.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage
Dialogue: 1,0:17:11.91,0:17:13.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,假如我推理得没错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.91,0:17:13.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If my reasoning is correct
Dialogue: 1,0:17:13.74,0:17:15.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我变成海绵宝宝的宠物  就能看到
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.74,0:17:15.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,as SpongeBob's pet, I'll get to witness
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.90,0:17:18.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹堡王从头做起的全过程
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.90,0:17:18.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Krabby Patties being made from scratch
Dialogue: 1,0:17:18.14,0:17:19.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后就能复制秘方
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.14,0:17:19.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Then I can copy the formula
Dialogue: 1,0:17:19.74,0:17:21.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一劳永逸地毁掉老螃蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.74,0:17:21.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and destroy Krabs, once and for all
Dialogue: 1,0:17:22.94,0:17:24.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你在这啊  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.94,0:17:24.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There you are, gare bear
Dialogue: 1,0:17:25.47,0:17:27.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你这淘气的小蜗牛  非要躲着我走
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.47,0:17:27.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You naughty little snail, hiding from me
Dialogue: 1,0:17:27.47,0:17:29.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我可得给你好好擦一把了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.47,0:17:29.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna give you a real good scrubbing
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.70,0:17:32.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你得干干净净才能参加带宠物上班日
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.70,0:17:31.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You have to be sparkly clean
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.36,0:17:32.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for bring your pet to work day
Dialogue: 1,0:17:33.47,0:17:35.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且刚好就是今天
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.47,0:17:35.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and today is the day
Dialogue: 1,0:17:36.82,0:17:37.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,首先要给你涂一点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.82,0:17:37.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,First I'm gonna start you off
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.93,0:17:39.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,气味香甜的沐浴露
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.93,0:17:39.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with a yummy-smelling shower gel
Dialogue: 1,0:17:39.91,0:17:40.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.91,0:17:40.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:43.14,0:17:44.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很好闻吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.14,0:17:44.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Smells nice, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:44.75,0:17:45.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.75,0:17:45.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.71,0:17:50.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就准备好搓个这辈子最彻底的澡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.71,0:17:50.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself for the scrubbing of a lifetime
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.25,0:17:58.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,应该很舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.25,0:17:58.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Guess that feels good, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.32,0:18:02.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.32,0:18:02.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Curses
Dialogue: 1,0:18:02.75,0:18:03.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是说
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.75,0:18:03.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean
Dialogue: 1,0:18:05.17,0:18:07.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗  你确定自己舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.17,0:18:07.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary, are you sure you're feeling all right?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:07.48,0:18:09.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,舒服到不能再舒服了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.48,0:18:09.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've never felt better
Dialogue: 1,0:18:09.50,0:18:10.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是说
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.50,0:18:10.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.12,0:18:15.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗  你都变绿了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.12,0:18:15.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary, you're turning green
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.10,0:18:16.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还会说话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.10,0:18:16.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And talking
Dialogue: 1,0:18:16.37,0:18:17.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我才没有
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.37,0:18:17.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not
Dialogue: 1,0:18:17.72,0:18:19.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这就把你带去宠物医院
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.72,0:18:19.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We got to get you to the pet hospital
Dialogue: 1,0:18:19.37,0:18:20.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,宠物医院吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.37,0:18:20.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pet hospital?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:20.70,0:18:23.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可现做的那批蟹黄堡怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.70,0:18:23.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But what about the fresh batch of Krabby Patties?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:23.04,0:18:23.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是说
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.04,0:18:23.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.23,0:18:24.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.23,0:18:24.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're right
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.98,0:18:27.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我这就给蟹老板打电话  说我会晚到
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.98,0:18:27.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll call Mr. Krabs and tell him I'm gonna be late
Dialogue: 1,0:18:27.50,0:18:29.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗  你生病就变得老爱讲话了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.50,0:18:29.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary, you're a lot more talkative when you're sick
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.92,0:18:32.00,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(826,548)}急诊
Dialogue: 1,0:18:31.03,0:18:32.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思  护士
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.03,0:18:32.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, nurse
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.25,0:18:34.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我家蜗牛老是说话  还变绿了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.25,0:18:34.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My snail has been talking and turning green
Dialogue: 1,0:18:34.47,0:18:35.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是病了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.47,0:18:35.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is he sick?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:46.22,0:18:47.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有病还是没病
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.22,0:18:47.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is that yes or no?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.97,0:18:50.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从来没见过这么极端的病例
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.97,0:18:50.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have never seen such a drastic case
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.86,0:18:53.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,赶紧把这只蜗牛送进重症监护室  快
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.86,0:18:53.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Rush this snail to the intensive care unit, stat
Dialogue: 1,0:18:54.08,0:18:55.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么重症监护室
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.08,0:18:55.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Intensive care unit?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:55.73,0:18:56.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放心  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.73,0:18:56.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.70,0:18:58.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们都是专业的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.70,0:18:58.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,These are professionals
Dialogue: 1,0:19:00.53,0:19:01.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,凯伦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.53,0:19:01.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Karen
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.50,0:19:03.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.50,0:19:03.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.47,0:19:05.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,认错了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.47,0:19:05.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I thought you were someone else
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.02,0:19:07.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要怕
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.02,0:19:07.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry
Dialogue: 1,0:19:08.10,0:19:12.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们只是要给你做一系列有创检查
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.10,0:19:09.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're just going to subject you
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.71,0:19:12.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to a series of invasive tests
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.75,0:19:14.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知不觉就会做完了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.75,0:19:14.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It'll be over before you know it
Dialogue: 1,0:19:23.85,0:19:25.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先生  医生刚才说的是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.85,0:19:25.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sir, all the doctor is saying is that
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.87,0:19:28.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你家蜗牛还得在重症监护室治疗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.87,0:19:28.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,your snail is still in the intensive care unit
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.86,0:19:31.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们必须再做几项检查
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.86,0:19:31.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and we just need to run a couple more tests
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.72,0:19:33.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那根本不是我说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.72,0:19:33.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's not what I'm saying at all
Dialogue: 1,0:19:34.80,0:19:36.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.80,0:19:36.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.31,0:19:43.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还是跟你实话实说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.31,0:19:43.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'll be honest with you, son
Dialogue: 1,0:19:43.62,0:19:45.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们所有办法都试过了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.62,0:19:45.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We've tried everything we can
Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.51,0:19:48.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是查不出它得了什么病
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.51,0:19:48.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We just can't find anything wrong with him
Dialogue: 1,0:19:48.20,0:19:50.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我从来就没见过这种症状
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.20,0:19:50.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like it
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.46,0:19:51.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拜托救救小蜗  医生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.46,0:19:51.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please try to save him, doctor
Dialogue: 1,0:19:55.00,0:19:56.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.00,0:19:56.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.20,0:19:57.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别再来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.20,0:19:57.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No more, please
Dialogue: 1,0:19:58.60,0:19:59.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别激动  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.60,0:19:59.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Relax, Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:19:59.70,0:20:00.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,检查完了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.70,0:20:00.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The tests are over
Dialogue: 1,0:20:00.96,0:20:04.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我只是来给你一片小药片的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.96,0:20:04.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm just here to give you a little pill
Dialogue: 1,0:20:05.25,0:20:06.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.25,0:20:06.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's a relief
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.64,0:20:08.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,张嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.64,0:20:08.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now open wide
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.06,0:20:15.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不算太苦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.06,0:20:15.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That wasn't so bad, was it?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:28.85,0:20:30.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,根本不算好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.85,0:20:30.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's not good
Dialogue: 1,0:20:31.30,0:20:32.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝先生
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.30,0:20:32.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. SquarePants?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:33.40,0:20:34.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.40,0:20:34.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.42,0:20:36.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,医生说已经无能为力了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.42,0:20:36.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The doctor said there's nothing more we can do
Dialogue: 1,0:20:36.91,0:20:40.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最好带它回家  让它自生自灭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.91,0:20:40.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's best to take him home and let nature take its course
Dialogue: 1,0:20:40.57,0:20:41.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你  你是说小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.57,0:20:41.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Y-You're saying that he's--
Dialogue: 1,0:20:41.76,0:20:42.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗可能会
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.76,0:20:42.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that he might--
Dialogue: 1,0:20:44.20,0:20:44.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,护士
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.20,0:20:44.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nurse?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:45.25,0:20:45.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,护士
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.25,0:20:45.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nurse?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.62,0:20:47.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.62,0:20:47.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:20:47.85,0:20:49.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来我们之间
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.85,0:20:49.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,this looks like it might be
Dialogue: 1,0:20:50.10,0:20:51.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,缘分将尽
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.10,0:20:51.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The end
Dialogue: 1,0:20:53.90,0:20:56.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真想吃一个
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.90,0:20:56.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If I could just have a
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.72,0:21:00.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹黄堡  然后再离开这世界
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.72,0:21:00.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Krabby Patty before I go
Dialogue: 1,0:21:01.35,0:21:02.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没问题  小兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.35,0:21:02.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sure thing, little buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:21:02.92,0:21:03.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.92,0:21:03.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sure
Dialogue: 1,0:21:04.15,0:21:06.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这种事情太悲惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.15,0:21:06.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You know, it's really poignant
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.65,0:21:07.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,咋悲惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.65,0:21:07.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What is?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.28,0:21:09.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你会说话了  我们却
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.28,0:21:09.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, now that you can talk, we're--
Dialogue: 1,0:21:09.90,0:21:12.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们却来不及说句  我爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.90,0:21:12.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we're running out of time to say "I love you"
Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.58,0:21:14.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.58,0:21:14.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.02,0:21:18.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们再次感谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.02,0:21:18.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So once again, we'd like to thank you
Dialogue: 1,0:21:18.21,0:21:19.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,选择背壳旅社
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.21,0:21:19.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for choosing club shell
Dialogue: 1,0:21:19.74,0:21:22.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,希望我们可以再次见面
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.74,0:21:22.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and we hope to see you again real soon
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.82,0:21:24.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再走一段路就到了  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.82,0:21:24.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just a little further, gare bear
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.90,0:21:29.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.90,0:21:29.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.11,0:21:46.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,兄弟  你待在这
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.11,0:21:46.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Buddy, you just stay right here
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.00,0:21:48.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老爸我要去拿秘密配方
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.00,0:21:48.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and daddy's gonna go get the secret formula
Dialogue: 1,0:21:48.39,0:21:51.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给你现做出史上最新鲜的一批蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.39,0:21:51.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and whip you up the best batch that we ever whipped up
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.42,0:21:52.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我马上就回来  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.42,0:21:52.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Be right back, gare bear
Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.60,0:21:55.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  大傻子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.60,0:21:55.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, fine fool
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.72,0:21:58.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等你捅了篓子回来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.72,0:21:58.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come right back with your complete undoing
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.30,0:21:59.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就要胜利了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.30,0:21:59.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and victory will be mine
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.21,0:22:03.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,妈啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.21,0:22:03.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mommy?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.04,0:22:05.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等下
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.04,0:22:05.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.72,0:22:13.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.72,0:22:13.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.95,0:22:26.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.95,0:22:26.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good day, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.25,0:22:28.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要来这里试吃
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.25,0:22:28.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm just here to sample
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.16,0:22:30.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们这边几个美味的蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.16,0:22:30.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,some of your delicious krabby fare
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.13,0:22:33.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别急  乖狗狗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.13,0:22:33.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Whoa, there, fido
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.65,0:22:35.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我这就走
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.65,0:22:35.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm going
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.37,0:22:36.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我这就走
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.37,0:22:36.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm going
Dialogue: 1,0:22:37.82,0:22:39.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗也太会当保安了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.82,0:22:39.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary's doing a great job as bouncer
Dialogue: 1,0:22:39.67,0:22:40.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对吧  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.67,0:22:40.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,huh, Mr. Krabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.65,0:22:42.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对得起那份工资
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.65,0:22:42.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Really earning his pay
Dialogue: 1,0:22:42.10,0:22:44.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他真是随了你啊  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.10,0:22:44.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, he takes after you, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.95,0:22:45.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,工资
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.95,0:22:45.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pay?
